<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets 2-wk rev repo, limit rate 14.5pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets 2-wk rev repo, limit rate 14.5pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) set a two-week reverse repo tender on Monday to drain liquidity at a limit rate of 14.5 percent, unchanged from its last operation on Friday.</p>
<p>The deadline for bids is 0815 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
